      excerpt: 'Manage customer relationships effectively with these powerful yet affordable CRM solutions.',
      image: '/images/unsplash/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978-1200w.webp',
      slug: 'blog/best-crm-software-small-business',
      readTime: '6 min read'
    },
    {
